We are so excited to welcome [@thestylishglobeskater](https://www.instagram.com/thestylishglobeskater/) [@sourgrapism](https://www.instagram.com/sourgrapism/) [@keepitfiz](https://www.instagram.com/keepitfiz/) [@thesunskater](https://www.instagram.com/thesunskater/) [@kvady.s](https://www.instagram.com/kvady.s/) and [@laura_rollerdancer](https://www.instagram.com/laura_rollerdancer/) as instructors, and DJ Nadia Sourgrapism and [@vibineze](https://www.instagram.com/vibineze/) DJ Eze as our DJs for the Roller Party!\
☀️With this event, we hope to plant a seed to help the Rollerdance community in Madrid grow!\
Thanks to all the collaborators for making this festival possible!\
Very soon, we will be posting registration info by Google form for each workshop! ✏️\
\
🎫 Tickets for Nadia’s workshop and Saturday’s Roller Party are now available!!\
🛼🛼🪩💜💛🤍\
\
(Please note that some locations, such as the Friday and Sunday Jams, are subject to change depending on permits and the weather, but we will let you know as soon as possible!)\
\
We can't wait to see you all in MADrid!!
